text On the usual road, there is not a single person wearing the uniform that I have seen before so many times.
text Well, of course I wouldn't.
text I am about the only one who would start going to school this late.
text To be honest, I really don't want to go to school.
text Then why...?
text Why am I walking down this path...?
text What am I expecting...?
text ......
text That's right... when I am late and walking this road, usually behind me, there would─
